# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Labas isulat: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: ([''] tccompare: ['']), bagong-linya.
